&lt;p&gt;04&sol;2024 - Transmittal 12571 issued April 11, 2024, The purpose of this Change Request (CR) is to make contractors aware of policy updates for Percutaneous Transluminal Angioplasty (PTA) of the Carotid Artery Concurrent with
